The ratings is a list of 1, 0, and 2.
The last is the last position of ratings.
The candies is an empty list of whole numbers.
For every spot from 0 to last.
Place 1 into candies.

For every spot from 1 to last.
If item spot of ratings is more than item (spot minus 1) of ratings, set item spot of candies to item (spot minus 1) of candies plus 1.

For every step from 0 to last.
The spot is last minus step.
If spot is less than last and item spot of ratings is more than item (spot plus 1) of ratings.
If item spot of candies is at most item (spot plus 1) of candies, set item spot of candies to item (spot plus 1) of candies plus 1.

The total is 0.
For each candy in candies.
Add candy to total.

Show total.
